---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/skins-studio.css";

const title = "Skins Studio · Muntrume Motorsport (skins.muntru.me)";
const description =
  "Estudio web local-first de skins y liveries para iRacing de Muntrume Motorsport: detección asistida de zonas sobre plantillas oficiales, compositor 2K/4K, visor WebGL 3D, copiloto Gemini y exportación directa TGA/Spec Map + ZIP para Trading Paints.";
const canonical = "https://skins.muntru.me/";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <main id="mmtSkinsStudio" class="sk-root">
    <!-- Private Auth Gate Landing Page (shown when unauthenticated; unlocks Studio only with valid muntru.me session) -->
    <section id="skAuthGate" class="sk-landing">
      <div class="sk-landing-wrap">
        <div class="sk-landing-hero">
          <div class="sk-landing-copy">
            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
              <span class="sk-brand-badge">MUNTRUME MOTORSPORT (MMT) · SKINS STUDIO</span>
              <span class="sk-tag" style="border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.4);color:#fcd34d;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.10);">ACCESO PRIVADO · SOLO PILOTOS AUTORIZADOS</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="sk-landing-title">
              Estudio de diseño 2D/3D y exportación de <span>liveries para iRacing</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="sk-landing-lead">
              Herramienta interna de <strong>Muntrume Motorsport</strong> para componer diseños de alta resolución (2K/4K), previsualizar acabados PBR/Spec Map en Three.js y preparar paquetes <code>.tga</code> / <code>.zip</code> listos para Trading Paints.
            </p>

            <div id="skAuthError" class="sk-landing-status">Inicia sesión con tu cuenta autorizada de muntru.me para desbloquear el estudio.</div>

            <div class="sk-landing-cta">
              <a
                href="https://muntru.me/login/?redirect=https://skins.muntru.me/"
                class="sk-btn sk-btn-primary sk-btn-lg"
                style="text-decoration:none;"
              >
                Iniciar sesión con cuenta muntru.me →
              </a>
              <a
                href="mailto:admin@muntru.me?subject=Solicitud%20de%20acceso%20a%20skins.muntru.me"
                class="sk-btn sk-btn-lg"
                style="text-decoration:none;"
              >
                Solicitar acceso / Contacto equipo
              </a>
            </div>

            <details class="sk-token-details">
              <summary>Acceso alternativo con token de sesión (<code>mrt_vault_token</code>)</summary>
              <div class="sk-row" style="margin-top:10px;">
                <input id="skAuthTokenInput" type="password" class="sk-input" placeholder="Pega aquí tu token JWT del Vault..." autocomplete="off" />
                <button type="button" id="skAuthVerifyBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Validar</button>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>

          <!-- Clean Conceptual 3-Step Visual Preview Mockup (zero private data exposed) -->
          <div class="sk-landing-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="sk-visual-chrome">
              <span class="sk-dot"></span><span class="sk-dot"></span><span class="sk-dot"></span>
              <span class="sk-visual-url">skins.muntru.me · Flujo 2K/4K → Three.js 3D → Trading Paints</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sk-visual-grid">
              <div class="sk-visual-uv">
                <div class="sk-uv-zone sk-uv-hood"><span>CAPÓ · #16 / #1 / #22</span></div>
                <div class="sk-uv-zone sk-uv-roof"><span>TECHO · DORSAL</span></div>
                <div class="sk-uv-zone sk-uv-left"><span>LATERAL IZQ.</span></div>
                <div class="sk-uv-zone sk-uv-right"><span>LATERAL DER. (L↔R)</span></div>
                <div class="sk-uv-zone sk-uv-wing"><span>ALERÓN · MMT</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="sk-visual-specs">
                <div class="sk-spec-chip"><strong>01 · UV 2K/4K</strong><span>Capas, dorsales y simetría</span></div>
                <div class="sk-spec-chip"><strong>02 · Visor 3D PBR</strong><span>Mate · Metálico · Carbono</span></div>
                <div class="sk-spec-chip"><strong>03 · Export TGA</strong><span>car_&lt;id&gt;.tga + Spec Map</span></div>
                <div class="sk-spec-chip"><strong>Acceso Vault</strong><span>Solo pilotos muntru.me</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3-Step Studio Workflow Bento Grid -->
        <div class="sk-bento">
          <article class="sk-bento-card">
            <span class="sk-bento-kicker">PASO 01 · COMPOSICIÓN UV 2K/4K</span>
            <h3>Capas, dorsales #16, #1, #22 y simetría automática</h3>
            <p>Edición visual sin Photoshop sobre coordenadas UV calibradas, simetría L↔R instantánea y respeto automático de los huecos de dorsal y serie de iRacing.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="sk-bento-card">
            <span class="sk-bento-kicker">PASO 02 · PREVISUALIZACIÓN 3D &amp; SPEC MAP</span>
            <h3>Acabados mate, metálico y fibra de carbono</h3>
            <p>Proyección 2D → 3D en tiempo real con Three.js, reflejos de estudio configurables (Mediodía, Atardecer, Boxes) y control real de canales RGB del Spec Map.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="sk-bento-card">
            <span class="sk-bento-kicker">PASO 03 · EXPORTACIÓN .TGA + GUÍA TRADING PAINTS</span>
            <h3>Listo para Documents\iRacing\paint\ y ficha de cámara</h3>
            <p>Generación binaria local de <code>car_&lt;id&gt;.tga</code>, <code>car_spec_&lt;id&gt;.tga</code> y paquete <code>.zip</code> junto a la guía de circuito, luz y ángulos <code>Ctrl+F12</code>.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div id="skStudioShell" class="sk-hidden" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;min-height:0;">
    <!-- Top Studio Header -->
    <header class="sk-topbar">
      <div class="sk-brand">
        <span class="sk-brand-badge">MMT SKINS STUDIO</span>
        <div>
          <h1 class="sk-title">skins.muntru.me</h1>
          <div class="sk-subtitle">Compositor iRacing 2K/4K · Siluetas UV sin copy · Muntrume AI · Trading Paints</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sk-top-actions">
        <span id="skStatusPill" class="sk-status-pill is-ok">Listo · Procesamiento 100 % local en navegador</span>
        <div class="sk-seg" role="group" aria-label="Resolución de exportación">
          <button type="button" data-res-mode="2048" class="is-active">2048 px</button>
          <button type="button" data-res-mode="4096">4096 px (4K)</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="skCleanCanvasBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Limpiar lienzo</button>
        <button type="button" id="skSaveLocalBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Guardar preset</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 3-Column Workstation -->
    <div class="sk-workspace">
      <!-- LEFT SIDEBAR: Car, Driver, Template & Zones, Presets -->
      <aside class="sk-sidebar">
        <section class="sk-card">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">Coche y Piloto</h2>
          <label class="sk-label">
            Coche iRacing (adapta zonas automáticamente)
            <select id="skCarSelect" class="sk-select"></select>
          </label>
          <p id="skCarNotes" class="sk-help"></p>

          <label class="sk-label">
            Piloto MMT
            <select id="skDriverSelect" class="sk-select"></select>
          </label>

          <div class="sk-grid-2">
            <label class="sk-label">
              Dorsal
              <input id="skDriverNumber" type="text" class="sk-input" maxlength="4" value="16" />
            </label>
            <label class="sk-label">
              iRacing Customer ID
              <input id="skCustomerId" type="text" class="sk-input" placeholder="994512" />
            </label>
          </div>

          <label class="sk-label">
            Nombre del diseño
            <input id="skDesignName" type="text" class="sk-input" />
          </label>
        </section>

        <section class="sk-card">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">
            <span>Plantilla iRacing y Zonas</span>
            <button type="button" id="skResetZones" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Restaurar</button>
          </h2>
          <label class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm sk-btn-primary" style="cursor:pointer;">
            Cargar plantilla oficial iRacing (.PSD / .PNG / .TGA)
            <input id="skTemplateInput" type="file" accept=".psd,.png,.tga,.webp,.jpg,.jpeg" class="sk-hidden" />
          </label>
          <p id="skTemplateSummary" class="sk-help">
            Suelta directamente el archivo <code>.PSD</code> oficial de iRacing (o PNG/TGA) en local: separa automáticamente el wireframe (guía) y las piezas/stickers del coche para pintar 1:1 sin Photoshop.
          </p>
          <div class="sk-row" style="justify-content:space-between;">
            <label class="sk-row" style="font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;">
              <input id="skToggleWireframe" type="checkbox" checked /> Guía plantilla
            </label>
            <label class="sk-row" style="font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;">
              <input id="skToggleZones" type="checkbox" /> Cajas de zona
            </label>
          </div>
          <label class="sk-label">
            Opacidad guía de plantilla
            <input id="skWireOpacity" type="range" min="10" max="100" value="85" />
          </label>
          <div id="skZoneList" class="sk-zone-list"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="sk-card">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">Presets Base y Remezcla</h2>
          <div id="skPresetList" class="sk-preset-list"></div>
          <div class="sk-row">
            <button type="button" id="skExportJsonBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="flex:1;">Exportar .JSON</button>
            <label class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="flex:1;cursor:pointer;">
              Importar .JSON
              <input id="skImportJsonInput" type="file" accept=".json" class="sk-hidden" />
            </label>
          </div>
          <h3 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:4px;">Biblioteca local</h3>
          <div id="skSavedLibrary" class="sk-preset-list"></div>
        </section>
      </aside>

      <!-- CENTER VIEWPORT: GT/iRacing Paint Shop / UV 2D / WebGL 3D / Spec Map -->
      <section class="sk-stage-col">
        <div class="sk-stage-bar">
          <div class="sk-seg" role="tablist" aria-label="Modo de previsualización">
            <button type="button" data-view-mode="uv" class="is-active">Mapa UV 2D</button>
            <button type="button" data-view-mode="showroom">Pintor GT / iRacing</button>
            <button type="button" data-view-mode="3d">Visor 3D WebGL</button>
            <button type="button" data-view-mode="spec">Spec Map (RGB)</button>
          </div>

          <div id="skShowroomControls" class="sk-row sk-hidden">
            <div class="sk-seg" role="group" aria-label="Ángulo de cámara GT">
              <button type="button" data-showroom-angle="side" class="is-active">Lateral</button>
              <button type="button" data-showroom-angle="top">Superior</button>
              <button type="button" data-showroom-angle="front">Frontal</button>
              <button type="button" data-showroom-angle="rear">Trasera</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="skUvControls" class="sk-row">
            <button type="button" id="skZoomOut" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" aria-label="Alejar">−</button>
            <span id="skZoomLabel" style="font-size:11px;font-family:monospace;min-width:40px;text-align:center;">100%</span>
            <button type="button" id="skZoomIn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" aria-label="Acercar">+</button>
            <button type="button" id="skZoomReset" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Centrar</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="skCanvasWrap" class="sk-canvas-wrap">
          <canvas id="skShowroomCanvas" class="sk-hidden" width="1024" height="640" style="width:100%;max-width:960px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:0 20px 54px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);"></canvas>
          <canvas id="skUvCanvas" class="sk-uv-canvas" width="1024" height="1024"></canvas>
          <canvas id="skGlCanvas" class="sk-gl-canvas sk-hidden"></canvas>

          <div id="skGlOverlay" class="sk-gl-overlay sk-hidden">
            <div id="skGlNotice" class="sk-gl-notice">
              Visor 3D Three.js PBR en tiempo real (arrastra para orbitar · rueda para zoom)
            </div>
            <div class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-gl-cam="front34">Frontal 3/4</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-gl-cam="side">Lateral</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-gl-cam="rear34">Trasera 3/4</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-gl-cam="top">Cenital</button>
              <span style="width:1px;height:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);margin:0 2px;"></span>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm is-active" data-gl-light="noon">Mediodía</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-gl-light="sunset">Atardecer</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-gl-light="overcast">Nublado / Boxes</button>
              <span style="width:1px;height:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);margin:0 2px;"></span>
              <label class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="cursor:pointer;">
                Cargar .GLB / .GLTF / .OBJ
                <input id="skObjInput" type="file" accept=".glb,.gltf,.obj" class="sk-hidden" />
              </label>
              <button type="button" id="skGlResetMesh" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Reset</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick GT-style 1-Click Sponsor Placement Bar -->
        <div class="sk-stage-bar" style="border-top:1px solid var(--sk-border);border-bottom:none;">
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sk-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;">Colocar sponsor en:</span>
          <div class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-quick-zone="hood">+ Capó</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-quick-zone="leftSide">+ Laterales (L↔R)</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-quick-zone="roof">+ Techo</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-quick-zone="rearWing">+ Alerón</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-quick-zone="frontBumper">+ Parachoques</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- RIGHT INSPECTOR: Design / Decals / Gemini IA / Export & Photo Guide -->
      <aside class="sk-inspector">
        <div class="sk-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Paneles del editor">
          <button type="button" class="sk-tab is-active" data-right-tab="design">Diseño</button>
          <button type="button" class="sk-tab" data-right-tab="decals">Decals</button>
          <button type="button" class="sk-tab" data-right-tab="gemini">Muntrume AI</button>
          <button type="button" class="sk-tab" data-right-tab="export">Exportar</button>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 1: DESIGN -->
        <div id="skTab-design" class="sk-card">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">Patrón y Paleta</h2>
          <label class="sk-label">
            Distribución base (12 estilos pro)
            <select id="skPatternSelect" class="sk-select">
              <option value="endurance">MMT Endurance (Cuñas IMSA / WEC)</option>
              <option value="geo-camo">DTM Geo-Camo (Camuflaje Splinter)</option>
              <option value="hex-tech">Hex Carbon Tech (Malla Hexagonal)</option>
              <option value="apex-fade">Apex Gradient Fade (Degradado GTWC)</option>
              <option value="factory-chevron">Factory V-Chevron (Equipo Oficial)</option>
              <option value="lightning-drift">Apex Lightning (Rayos Eléctricos)</option>
              <option value="heritage-gulf">Heritage Classic (Banda Ancha Gulf)</option>
              <option value="sprint">MMT Sprint (Doble Franja + Faldones)</option>
              <option value="carbon-stealth">Carbono Stealth (Facetas Neón)</option>
              <option value="tricolor">Tricolor Motorsport (Diagonales)</option>
              <option value="clean-minimal">Limpio Minimal (Escudería Bitono)</option>
              <option value="freeform">Diseño Libre (Base limpia sin gráfico)</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <div id="skPatternGallery" class="sk-pattern-gallery" aria-label="Galería visual de patrones de pintura"></div>

          <div id="skPsdPatternsBox" class="sk-psd-patterns sk-hidden">
            <div class="sk-row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
              <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sk-accent);">PATRONES OFICIALES DEL .PSD (RGB)</span>
              <button type="button" id="skPsdPatternClear" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Usar patrón MMT</button>
            </div>
            <label class="sk-label" style="margin-top:4px;">
              Pintura nativa iRacing (se recolorea con Primario / Secundario / Acento)
              <select id="skPsdPatternSelect" class="sk-select"></select>
            </label>
          </div>

          <label class="sk-label">
            Textura sobre pintura (2K / 4K)
            <select id="skSurfaceTexture" class="sk-select">
              <option value="none">Lisa (Sin textura adicional)</option>
              <option value="carbon">Fibra de Carbono 2×2</option>
              <option value="hex-mesh">Malla Hexagonal Tech</option>
              <option value="speed-lines">Líneas Aerodinámicas</option>
              <option value="metallic-flake">Flake Metálico Fino</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <div class="sk-pal-grid" aria-label="Paletas rápidas motorsport">
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#16202e,#243447,#00e699,#f8fafc,endurance"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#16202e"></i><i style="background:#00e699"></i></span>MMT Esmeralda</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#0f141c,#273447,#ef4444,#f8fafc,geo-camo"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#0f141c"></i><i style="background:#ef4444"></i></span>DTM Geo-Red</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#090d14,#132238,#06b6d4,#00ff9d,hex-tech"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#132238"></i><i style="background:#06b6d4"></i></span>Hex Cyber</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#0a1128,#1d4ed8,#f97316,#ffffff,apex-fade"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#1d4ed8"></i><i style="background:#f97316"></i></span>Apex Fade</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#38bdf8,#0369a1,#f97316,#0f172a,heritage-gulf"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#38bdf8"></i><i style="background:#f97316"></i></span>Gulf Classic</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#f8fafc,#0f172a,#dc2626,#facc15,factory-chevron"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#f8fafc"></i><i style="background:#dc2626"></i></span>Factory Red</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#0b0f14,#18222d,#84cc16,#ffffff,carbon-stealth"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#0b0f14"></i><i style="background:#84cc16"></i></span>Squadra Lime</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#f8fafc,#1e3a8a,#dc2626,#38bdf8,tricolor"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#1e3a8a"></i><i style="background:#dc2626"></i></span>Martini Pro</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#0b0f17,#1e1b4b,#eab308,#38bdf8,lightning-drift"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#0b0f17"></i><i style="background:#eab308"></i></span>Stealth Gold</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-pal-chip" data-quick-pal="#f97316,#0f172a,#38bdf8,#ffffff,sprint"><span class="sk-pal-dots"><i style="background:#f97316"></i><i style="background:#0f172a"></i></span>Papaya GT</button>
          </div>

          <div class="sk-grid-2">
            <label class="sk-color-item"><span>Primario</span><input id="skColorPrimary" type="color" /></label>
            <label class="sk-color-item"><span>Secundario</span><input id="skColorSecondary" type="color" /></label>
            <label class="sk-color-item"><span>Acento MMT</span><input id="skColorAccent" type="color" /></label>
            <label class="sk-color-item"><span>Detalles</span><input id="skColorDetail" type="color" /></label>
            <label class="sk-color-item"><span>Texto Dorsal</span><input id="skColorNum" type="color" /></label>
            <label class="sk-color-item"><span>Fondo Dorsal</span><input id="skColorNumBg" type="color" /></label>
          </div>

          <div class="sk-row" style="justify-content:space-between;">
            <label class="sk-label" style="flex:1;">
              Tipografía dorsales
              <select id="skFontSelect" class="sk-select">
                <option value="racing-bold">Racing Bold (Inter)</option>
                <option value="condensed-gt">GT Condensed</option>
                <option value="mono-tech">Tech Mono</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>
          <label class="sk-row" style="font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;">
            <input id="skShowNumber" type="checkbox" checked /> Pintar dorsal en techo y capó (respeta placas laterales de iRacing)
          </label>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:6px;">Spec Map iRacing (Acabado)</h2>
          <label class="sk-label">
            Tipo de pintura
            <select id="skFinishSelect" class="sk-select">
              <option value="gloss">Brillo (Gloss)</option>
              <option value="satin">Satinado (Satin)</option>
              <option value="matte">Mate (Matte)</option>
              <option value="metallic">Metálico (Metallic)</option>
              <option value="chrome">Cromado (Chrome)</option>
              <option value="carbon">Fibra de Carbono</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="sk-label">Canal R · Metálico<input id="skSpecMetallic" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label>
          <label class="sk-label">Canal G · Rugosidad (Mate)<input id="skSpecRoughness" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label>
          <label class="sk-label">Canal B · Laca (Clearcoat)<input id="skSpecClearcoat" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label>
          <label class="sk-row" style="font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;">
            <input id="skCarbonWeave" type="checkbox" /> Trama de carbono visible sobre base
          </label>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:6px;">Diseño Libre · Pincel y Formas</h2>
          <div class="sk-row">
            <button type="button" id="skBrushToggle" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="flex:1;">Pincel libre: OFF</button>
            <input id="skBrushColor" type="color" value="#00e699" style="width:34px;height:28px;border:none;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;" title="Color del pincel" />
          </div>
          <div class="sk-row" style="justify-content:space-between;">
            <label class="sk-label" style="flex:1;">Grosor pincel<input id="skBrushSize" type="range" min="1" max="12" value="3" /></label>
            <label class="sk-row" style="font-size:11px;cursor:pointer;"><input id="skBrushMirror" type="checkbox" checked /> Simetría L/R</label>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-row">
            <button type="button" id="skBrushUndo" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="flex:1;">Deshacer trazo</button>
            <button type="button" id="skBrushClear" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm sk-btn-danger" style="flex:1;">Limpiar pincel</button>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-add-shape="stripe">+ Franja libre</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-add-shape="triangle">+ Triángulo</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-add-shape="circle">+ Círculo</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 2: DECALS & SPONSORS (TEAM + SERIES + BRANDS) -->
        <div id="skTab-decals" class="sk-card sk-hidden">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">Escudería Muntrume (MMT)</h2>
          <div id="skTeamDecals" class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;"></div>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:4px;">Series de iRacing</h2>
          <div id="skSeriesDecals" class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;"></div>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:4px;">Marcas / Fabricantes</h2>
          <div id="skBrandDecals" class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;"></div>

          <div id="skBuiltinDecals" class="sk-hidden"></div>

          <div class="sk-row" style="margin-top:4px;">
            <input id="skCustomTextInput" type="text" class="sk-input" placeholder="Texto sponsor o piloto..." />
            <button type="button" id="skAddTextDecal" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">+ Texto</button>
          </div>

          <label class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="cursor:pointer;">
            Subir logo propio (PNG / SVG transparente)
            <input id="skUploadLogoInput" type="file" accept=".png,.svg,.webp" class="sk-hidden" />
          </label>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:4px;">Capas activas</h2>
          <div id="skDecalList" class="sk-layer-list"></div>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:4px;">Ajuste de capa seleccionada</h2>
          <div id="skDecalEditor"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 3: MUNTRUME AI AUTO-DESIGNER -->
        <div id="skTab-gemini" class="sk-card sk-hidden">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">Muntrume AI · Diseñador Automático</h2>
          <p class="sk-help">
            ¿No quieres complicarte con capas? Elige serie y estilo y <strong>Muntrume AI limpia el lienzo y diseña el coche completo automáticamente</strong> (colores, acabado, logos MMT, marca y serie) listo para exportar.
          </p>

          <label class="sk-label">
            Serie / Campeonato iRacing
            <select id="skAiSeriesSelect" class="sk-select">
              <option value="IMSA Endurance">IMSA Endurance</option>
              <option value="GT Sprint">GT Sprint Series</option>
              <option value="Porsche Cup">Porsche Cup 992</option>
              <option value="PCC">Production Car Challenge (PCC)</option>
              <option value="SFL">Super Formula Lights</option>
              <option value="24H Special Event">24H Special Event</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <div class="sk-row" style="flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-ai-quick="Endurance oscuro carbono y verde esmeralda MMT elegante">Carbono MMT</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-ai-quick="Sprint blanco agresivo con franjas negras y acento esmeralda">Sprint Blanco</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" data-ai-quick="Estilo oficial de fábrica minimalista metálico de alta legibilidad">Fábrica Pro</button>
          </div>

          <label class="sk-label">
            O describe tu idea libremente
            <textarea id="skGeminiPrompt" class="sk-textarea" placeholder="Ej: Livery 24h de Spa agresiva con carbono expuesto, verde esmeralda eléctrico y detalles blancos muy visibles de noche..."></textarea>
          </label>

          <button type="button" id="skGeminiDesignBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-primary">Diseñar coche completo con Muntrume AI</button>

          <div id="skGeminiOutput"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 4: EXPORT & TRADING PAINTS PHOTO GUIDE -->
        <div id="skTab-export" class="sk-card sk-hidden">
          <h2 class="sk-card-title">Exportar para iRacing y Trading Paints</h2>
          <div id="skExportValidation" class="sk-shot-card"></div>

          <!-- PASO 1: PINTURA PRINCIPAL (DIFFUSE) -->
          <div class="sk-shot-card" style="border-color:rgba(0,230,153,0.45);">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;">
              <canvas id="skExportDiffusePreview" width="96" height="96" style="width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);background:#090d14;flex-shrink:0;"></canvas>
              <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;">
                <span class="sk-tag" style="background:rgba(0,230,153,0.16);color:var(--sk-accent);border-color:rgba(0,230,153,0.4);">1 · SUBIR DIRECTO (PINTURA)</span>
                <strong id="skExportDiffuseName" style="display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;">car_994512.tga</strong>
                <p class="sk-help" style="margin:2px 0 0;">Archivo principal de color y logos. En Trading Paints se sube primero en <strong>Upload a paint</strong>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" id="skExportTgaBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-primary sk-btn-sm" style="margin-top:8px;width:100%;">
              Descargar Pintura Principal (car_&lt;id&gt;.tga)
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- PASO 2: SPEC MAP (ACABADO METÁLICO / MATE / BRILLO -> .MIP DE iRACING) -->
          <div class="sk-shot-card" style="border-color:rgba(56,189,248,0.4);">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;">
              <canvas id="skExportSpecPreview" width="96" height="96" style="width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);background:#090d14;flex-shrink:0;"></canvas>
              <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;">
                <span class="sk-tag" style="background:rgba(56,189,248,0.14);color:#38bdf8;border-color:rgba(56,189,248,0.4);">2 · SPEC MAP (.TGA → .MIP)</span>
                <strong id="skExportSpecName" style="display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;">car_spec_994512.tga</strong>
                <p class="sk-help" style="margin:2px 0 0;">Trading Paints pide el <code>.mip</code> generado por iRacing: copia este <code>.tga</code> en tu carpeta <code>paint\&lt;coche&gt;\</code>, abre el coche en iRacing (crea <code>car_spec_&lt;id&gt;.mip</code>) y sube ese <strong>.mip</strong> en <em>"Add spec map or decal layer ↓"</em>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" id="skExportSpecBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="margin-top:8px;width:100%;">
              Descargar Spec Map (car_spec_&lt;id&gt;.tga para iRacing)
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- PACK COMPLETO ZIP -->
          <button type="button" id="skExportZipBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm" style="width:100%;">
            Descargar Pack .ZIP completo (Pintura + Spec Map + Carpeta iRacing)
          </button>

          <div class="sk-shot-card">
            <strong>Resumen rápido Trading Paints</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>1. Sube <code>car_&lt;id&gt;.tga</code> directo en <a href="https://www.tradingpaints.com/my-paints" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--sk-accent);">Trading Paints → Upload a paint</a>.</li>
              <li>2. Para el acabado (mate/satinado/metálico): pon <code>car_spec_&lt;id&gt;.tga</code> en <code>Documents\iRacing\paint\&lt;coche&gt;\</code>, abre el coche en iRacing para que genere <code>car_spec_&lt;id&gt;.mip</code>, y sube ese <code>.mip</code> en <strong>"Add spec map or decal layer ↓"</strong>.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <h2 class="sk-card-title" style="margin-top:4px;">
            <span>Guía de circuito y ángulos de foto</span>
            <button type="button" id="skAiPhotoGuideBtn" class="sk-btn sk-btn-sm">Generar con IA</button>
          </h2>
          <div id="skPhotoGuideList" class="sk-preset-list"></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    import { initSkinsStudio } from "../../lib/skins/studio-app";
    if (document.readyState === "loading") {
      document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => initSkinsStudio(), { once: true });
    } else {
      initSkinsStudio();
    }
  </script>
</Layout>
